The required API sequence is:
1. Search for available Block Status to use in postBlock: GET /lov/v1/listOfValues/{{Name}}
2. Search for available Block Reservation Types: GET /lov/v1/listOfValues/hotels/{{HotelId}}/bookingStatus/{{BookingStatus}}/blockReservationTypes
3. Search for available rate codes to use in postBlock: GET /lov/v1/listOfValues/hotels/{{HotelId}}/beginDate/{{BeginDate}}/endDate/{{EndDate}}/negotiatedOnly/{{NegotiatedOnly}}/blockRateCodes
4. Search for Block Origin Codes: GET /lov/v1/listOfValues/{{Name}}
5. Search for Block Booking types: GET /lov/v1/listOfValues/{{Name}}
6. Get block default code to use in postBlock: GET /blk/v1/defaultBlockCode
7. Create a new Block: POST /blk/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/block
8. Create a new Catering Block: POST /blk/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/block
9. Add notes to a block: PUT /blk/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/blocks/{{BlockId}}
10. Get Block Next Status Codes: GET /blk/config/v1/blockStatusCodes/nextStatusCodes
11. Update the Blocks Status: PUT /blk/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/blocks/{{BlockId}}/status
12. Create a Posting Master Reservation on the block: POST /blk/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/blocks/{{BlockId}}/postingMaster

The required API sequence is:
1. Get Rate Categories for a property: GET /lov/v1/listOfValues/hotels/{{HotelId}}/rateCategories
2. Get Room Types for a property: GET /lov/v1/listOfValues/hotels/{{HotelId}}/resortRoomTypes
3. Get Market Codes for a property: GET /lov/v1/listOfValues/{{Name}}
4. Get Source codes for a property: GET /lov/v1/listOfValues/{{Name}}
5. Get Transaction Codes for a property: GET /lov/v1/listOfValues/{{Name}}
6. Get Rate Package Transaction Codes: GET /lov/v1/listOfValues/{{Name}}
7. Create a new Rate Plan: POST /rtp/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/ratePlans
8. Add packages to a Rate Plan: POST /rtp/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/ratePlans/{{RatePlanCode}}/packages
9. Update an existing Rate Plan: PUT /rtp/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/ratePlans/{{RatePlanCode}}
10. Get Room types available to add rate schedules: GET /lov/v1/listOfValues/{{Name}}
11. Create Rate Plan Schedules: POST /rtp/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/ratePlans/{{RatePlanCode}}/schedules
12. Create Rate Plan Schedules with a package: POST /rtp/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/ratePlans/{{RatePlanCode}}/schedules
13. Update a Rate Plan Schedule: PUT /rtp/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/ratePlans/{{RatePlanCode}}/schedules
14. Get existing Rate Plan Schedules: GET /rtp/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/ratePlans/{{RatePlanCode}}/schedules

The required API sequence is:
1. Create a new Room Maintenance Request: POST /hsk/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/rooms/maintenanceCodes/{{MaintenanceCode}}
2. Update an existing Room Maintenance Request: PUT /hsk/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/rooms/{{RoomId}}/maintenances/{{MaintenanceId}}
3. Resolve  a Room Maintenance Request: PUT /hsk/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/maintenances/{{MaintenanceId}}/resolve
4. unresolve a Room Maintenance Request: PUT /hsk/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/maintenances/{{MaintenanceId}}/unResolve
5. Delete a Room Maintenance Request: DELETE /hsk/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/maintenances/{{MaintenanceId}}
6. Find all existing Room Maintenance Requests: GET /hsk/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/rooms/maintenances

The required API sequence is:
1. Create a New Guest Message: POST /rsv/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/reservations/{{ReservationId}}/guestMessages
2. Get a Guest Message by reservationId: GET /rsv/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/reservations/{{ReservationId}}
3. Update Guest Message  - update delivered: PUT /rsv/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/reservations/{{ReservationId}}/guestMessages/{{GuestMessageId}}
4. Delete a Guest Message by ID: DELETE /rsv/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/reservations/{{ReservationId}}/guestMessages/{{GuestMessageId}}

The required API sequence is:
1. Add a reservation to the queue: PUT /fof/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/queuedReservations/{{ReservationId}}
2. Get reservations that are in Queue: GET /fof/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/queuedReservations
3. Remove a reservation from the queue: DELETE /fof/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/queuedReservations/{{ReservationId}}
4. Get reservation queue statistics: GET /fof/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/queueReservationsStatistics
